WEBVTT

00:00:01.770 --> 00:00:06.810
The fated day has finally arrived!

00:00:07.010 --> 00:00:12.440
In this huge battle to
decide the fate of Beyblading...

00:00:12.440 --> 00:00:16.300
Which team will take
home all the glory?!

00:00:17.610 --> 00:00:21.180
Howl! Roar! Gaia Dragoon!

00:00:25.720 --> 00:00:29.170
V-Temptation!

00:00:37.650 --> 00:00:41.740
Thunder Slash!

00:00:44.610 --> 00:00:48.450
Demolition Axe!

00:00:53.840 --> 00:00:56.690
Ocean Javelin!

00:01:06.340 --> 00:01:09.450
Aqua Shield!

00:01:15.810 --> 00:01:20.300
Take this! This is my love!!

00:01:26.600 --> 00:01:30.360
Radiant Thunder!

00:01:32.330 --> 00:01:36.300
Evolution Storm!

00:01:43.090 --> 00:01:45.300
This is Beyblade News.

00:01:45.300 --> 00:01:50.730
After the Justice 5 ended in a draw, BEGA Chairman Volkov

00:01:50.730 --> 00:01:57.940
has announced that a sixth match will take place with each team choosing one player to represent them.

00:01:58.640 --> 00:02:04.970
The Justice 5's sixth match!
This is going to be the real final battle!

00:03:36.150 --> 00:03:40.070
Time for the final battle!

00:03:40.070 --> 00:03:46.080
The finale is drawing
closer at BEGA HQ!

00:03:46.080 --> 00:03:50.160
What happens today will decide
the future of Beyblading!

00:03:50.160 --> 00:03:55.080
Who will win?
The G-Revolutions? Or BEGA?

00:03:55.080 --> 00:04:00.010
The whole world will be watching
the battle that's just ahead!

00:04:18.020 --> 00:04:20.530
Takao! You're up!

00:04:20.530 --> 00:04:22.200
Ready?

00:04:24.860 --> 00:04:26.320
--Takao!

00:04:29.160 --> 00:04:30.240
Yeah.

00:04:33.540 --> 00:04:36.000
We're counting
on you, Takao!

00:04:36.000 --> 00:04:38.210
Fight on, Takao!

00:04:38.210 --> 00:04:41.130
You better not lose,
you hear me?

00:04:41.130 --> 00:04:43.220
We believe in you.

00:04:43.220 --> 00:04:45.680
This is the final battle.

00:04:46.010 --> 00:04:48.140
Let's go, guys!

00:05:03.530 --> 00:05:06.110
I'm sure you understand.

00:05:06.860 --> 00:05:12.750
If things go well today, your place
in BEGA is all but guaranteed.

00:05:12.750 --> 00:05:19.170
But remember, if the
unthinkable happens...

00:05:19.420 --> 00:05:25.680
Pardon me. I'm certain there won't
be any more mistakes made today?

00:05:33.890 --> 00:05:35.980
Time to go.

00:05:41.650 --> 00:05:45.820
Time for both teams
to enter the arena!

00:05:58.000 --> 00:05:59.460
First!

00:06:00.210 --> 00:06:05.590
The team that grasped victory from the jaws of defeat! The G-Revolutions!

00:06:09.590 --> 00:06:15.390
This whole story started from their rejection
of BEGA's rule over Beyblading!

00:06:15.390 --> 00:06:20.100
And their representative is none
other than Takao Kinomiya!

00:06:22.570 --> 00:06:25.820
The time has finally come.
Let's do it!

00:06:25.820 --> 00:06:29.780
I hope you're watching.
Yuriy. Kai.

00:06:30.160 --> 00:06:35.240
In the other corner,
BEGA's team of elites!

00:06:35.240 --> 00:06:40.830
Who will represent them in this
battle to defend the pro league?!

00:07:07.650 --> 00:07:09.150
Brooklyn!

00:07:09.150 --> 00:07:12.280
What the heck
happened to him?!

00:07:12.950 --> 00:07:19.410
Brooklyn has come alone
from the BEGA corner!

00:07:19.410 --> 00:07:23.210
Are they gambling everything
on his natural talent?

00:07:23.210 --> 00:07:29.670
This battle of fate will be between Kinomiya and Brooklyn!

00:07:40.980 --> 00:07:44.940
This genius is motivated
enough to take up Beyblade.

00:07:44.940 --> 00:07:48.320
And then there's
Hitoshi Kinomiya.

00:07:48.320 --> 00:07:50.610
I imagine that this
is all his doing.

00:07:50.610 --> 00:07:55.530
If you're not ready for it, I imagine
you'll be the next to be sent to hell!

00:08:02.290 --> 00:08:04.710
I don't know
what you're up to...

00:08:04.710 --> 00:08:07.840
But I will win, no matter what
you've got up your sleeve!

00:08:07.840 --> 00:08:13.340
And I'll risk everything to
win, just like Kai did!

00:08:26.810 --> 00:08:28.860
You can feel
the intensity!

00:08:29.190 --> 00:08:31.940
The time has finally come.

00:08:32.240 --> 00:08:36.530
We just have to watch.

00:08:36.530 --> 00:08:40.410
We're about to find
out who will win.

00:08:40.410 --> 00:08:43.370
And find out
what path we'll take.

00:08:44.120 --> 00:08:45.710
Maybe?

00:08:46.960 --> 00:08:48.710
That's right.

00:08:49.460 --> 00:08:56.550
Will this battle become a holy land the likes
of which no normal person can enter?!

00:09:11.650 --> 00:09:16.240
Fight to your heart's
content in the Holy Stadium!

00:09:20.120 --> 00:09:21.660
Ready?

00:09:25.210 --> 00:09:26.620
Takao...

00:09:27.420 --> 00:09:29.040
Three!

00:09:29.840 --> 00:09:31.420
Two!

00:09:32.340 --> 00:09:33.760
One!

00:09:33.760 --> 00:09:37.430
Go, Shoot!!

00:09:57.820 --> 00:09:59.320
What?!

00:09:59.320 --> 00:10:03.740
Takao definitely launched first!

00:10:03.740 --> 00:10:07.960
Brooklyn doesn't even
know when to shoot!

00:10:07.960 --> 00:10:10.630
And what about the stadium?

00:10:10.630 --> 00:10:14.260
Takao!
Watch your landing!

00:10:18.380 --> 00:10:24.100
You're good, but this ain't
enough to scare me!

00:10:24.100 --> 00:10:26.680
Go, Dragoon!

00:10:37.030 --> 00:10:38.400
Darn!

00:10:45.620 --> 00:10:47.080
Wow!

00:10:47.080 --> 00:10:49.330
Go for it, Kinomiya!

00:10:49.330 --> 00:10:54.040
Kinomiya's fierce
attack is incredible!

00:10:54.040 --> 00:10:58.340
Is he aiming to settle the score
with BEGA right here and now?!

00:11:00.630 --> 00:11:02.430
Keep it up, Takao!

00:11:02.430 --> 00:11:05.640
Don't let up!
Finish him off!

00:11:05.640 --> 00:11:06.520
Brooklyn!

00:11:06.520 --> 00:11:08.060
He's not done yet!

00:11:09.310 --> 00:11:11.520
Look closely!

00:11:29.620 --> 00:11:33.540
How is Dragoon getting pushed
back after all those attacks?

00:11:34.040 --> 00:11:35.290
No...!

00:11:35.290 --> 00:11:39.970
He can still push Takao back even
after taking all those hits?

00:11:39.970 --> 00:11:45.970
It's the rotation speed! The rotation speed from that invisible shoot...

00:11:45.970 --> 00:11:50.680
It's blowing back Dragoon's
attacks with ease!

00:11:50.680 --> 00:11:57.570
Brooklyn can surpass the power of a normal Blader by two or three times with the flick of his finger.

00:11:57.900 --> 00:12:01.860
That's exactly why
Brooklyn is called a genius...

00:12:01.860 --> 00:12:04.910
There's no way a normal
person can beat him!

00:12:04.910 --> 00:12:09.160
But surpassing those limits is why
they call themselves a "revolution."

00:12:09.160 --> 00:12:12.330
What's your
next move, Takao?

00:12:13.120 --> 00:12:14.710
Crap...

00:12:15.580 --> 00:12:21.970
You're wasting your time. You can't beat me, no matter how much passion you put in.

00:12:22.170 --> 00:12:24.840
After all,
I can do anything.

00:12:24.840 --> 00:12:29.140
With just a little bit of effort, I can make
sure I never make another mistake again.

00:12:30.720 --> 00:12:34.440
Excellent, Brooklyn. You've toyed with him for long enough.

00:12:34.440 --> 00:12:36.560
Finish him!

00:12:38.440 --> 00:12:39.780
Farewell.

00:12:50.160 --> 00:12:51.620
What?

00:12:52.290 --> 00:12:53.790
Look!

00:13:04.470 --> 00:13:06.470
--Takao!

00:13:09.140 --> 00:13:16.940
"Bakuten Shoot Beyblade G-Revolution"

00:13:23.400 --> 00:13:27.200
Oh my!
This is incredible!

00:13:27.200 --> 00:13:32.240
Brooklyn has crumbled the
stadium with a single blow!

00:13:32.750 --> 00:13:36.330
Is Kinomiya okay?

00:13:43.670 --> 00:13:46.970
Takao!

00:13:55.680 --> 00:13:57.690
That one hurt.

00:13:58.150 --> 00:13:59.360
Takao!

00:14:00.110 --> 00:14:05.110
But I can't let a couple
of scrapes take me down!

00:14:05.610 --> 00:14:11.700
The future of Beyblading
is riding on me!

00:14:15.040 --> 00:14:17.460
Go, Dragoon!

00:14:19.460 --> 00:14:22.290
--Takao!

00:14:26.550 --> 00:14:31.350
Wow!
Kinomiya's back on his feet!

00:14:31.350 --> 00:14:35.100
His drive to win
this match is endless!

00:14:35.100 --> 00:14:39.850
He continues his all-out
attack on Brooklyn!

00:14:40.560 --> 00:14:42.440
That's Takao for you...

00:14:42.900 --> 00:14:45.480
But this is where
the battle truly begins.

00:14:46.110 --> 00:14:50.280
Now, Brooklyn. Stop Takao's attacks
with everything you've got!

00:14:50.280 --> 00:14:56.450
Hit him back with your passionate Beyspirit!
That's when you'll become the ultimate Blader!

00:14:56.950 --> 00:14:58.080
Fine.

00:15:03.670 --> 00:15:09.880
There it is! Brooklyn's high power
that can turn the tables in an instant!

00:15:09.880 --> 00:15:13.180
And yet,
Kinomiya is...!

00:15:21.560 --> 00:15:24.900
Fine!
Just get back up!

00:15:24.900 --> 00:15:29.530
I've had my fill
of fighting here.

00:15:29.530 --> 00:15:30.650
I'm...

00:15:32.110 --> 00:15:35.490
...Done fighting
on your field.

00:15:36.740 --> 00:15:38.370
I am a bird.

00:15:38.870 --> 00:15:41.620
Free to fly in the sky!

00:15:42.290 --> 00:15:44.920
No one can touch me.

00:15:45.290 --> 00:15:49.510
The rest of you can
grovel before me!!

00:16:02.440 --> 00:16:03.810
Takao!

00:16:04.020 --> 00:16:06.020
Hang in there, Takao!

00:16:06.690 --> 00:16:08.030
What is this?

00:16:08.980 --> 00:16:10.990
You're amazing!

00:16:10.990 --> 00:16:14.910
But what's going on...?
This feeling of dread...

00:16:18.620 --> 00:16:22.330
It's different compared
to Garland or Moses's.

00:16:22.330 --> 00:16:27.460
Brooklyn's so good, but there's no
passion behind any of his attacks!

00:16:29.760 --> 00:16:33.260
What is he?
What is he?

00:16:38.510 --> 00:16:44.560
It feels cold. Kai, did you
fight a heart this cold too?

00:16:50.690 --> 00:16:52.990
No! If this keeps up...

00:16:52.990 --> 00:16:55.450
Takao's going to
end up like Kai!

00:16:55.990 --> 00:16:58.780
I won't lose!
I'm going to...

00:16:58.780 --> 00:17:05.040
Burn these attacks
with our fiery Beyspirits!

00:17:11.380 --> 00:17:14.090
Why do you keep
getting back up?

00:17:14.090 --> 00:17:19.890
I see... You're going to
insult me too, are you?

00:17:19.890 --> 00:17:22.220
Are you making
fun of me?!

00:17:22.220 --> 00:17:24.430
I am a god!

00:17:24.980 --> 00:17:27.440
Your efforts are useless!

00:17:27.440 --> 00:17:33.190
Truly incredible! The finale of the
Justice 5 couldn't be grander!

00:17:33.190 --> 00:17:39.370
Kai Hiwatari miraculously turned it
around, but how will Kinomiya fare?!

00:17:47.250 --> 00:17:48.420
Shut up.

00:17:49.630 --> 00:17:51.300
You annoy me.

00:17:55.090 --> 00:17:59.260
Let's do it!

00:18:02.560 --> 00:18:04.560
All of you...

00:18:05.560 --> 00:18:08.440
No! Brooklyn, stop!

00:18:08.440 --> 00:18:11.820
Annoy me!!

00:18:38.260 --> 00:18:39.720
--What?!

00:19:02.660 --> 00:19:04.160
Brooklyn!

00:19:06.830 --> 00:19:08.160
Victory?

00:19:08.580 --> 00:19:10.000
Defeat?

00:19:10.210 --> 00:19:11.880
Beyspirit?

00:19:12.670 --> 00:19:16.420
I don't care about any
of that. I don't need it!

00:19:16.420 --> 00:19:18.470
So all of you...

00:19:18.470 --> 00:19:23.350
Must disappear!
Begone!!

00:19:35.110 --> 00:19:36.650
What is...

00:19:36.650 --> 00:19:39.150
What is going on here?!

00:19:39.150 --> 00:19:43.700
There's no logical explanation
for what's happening here!

00:19:43.700 --> 00:19:46.580
What's certain is that
this is an emergency!

00:19:53.250 --> 00:19:56.630
I never knew Brooklyn
was this strong!

00:19:58.210 --> 00:20:05.390
Incredible! Truly fantastic!
Bury the fools who dare get in our way!

00:20:27.280 --> 00:20:28.540
We're safe!

00:20:40.670 --> 00:20:43.050
We're not safe at all!

00:20:45.220 --> 00:20:48.430
This like,
can't be happening!

00:20:48.430 --> 00:20:50.560
What's happening?

00:20:55.270 --> 00:20:58.230
A Bey is a mirror that
reflects the soul of the Blader...

00:21:00.280 --> 00:21:04.910
Which means Zeus created this
world inside Brooklyn's mind!

00:21:04.910 --> 00:21:07.490
This is Brooklyn's heart!

00:21:08.160 --> 00:21:09.700
What?!

00:21:10.120 --> 00:21:11.620
Brooklyn...!

00:21:14.540 --> 00:21:19.090
Yes! I am a bird! I can fly in the sky whenever I please!

00:21:19.090 --> 00:21:23.300
Anyone who gets in
my way must disappear!

00:21:25.380 --> 00:21:28.140
Brooklyn...
What are you...

00:21:28.140 --> 00:21:30.390
Hey, Takao!

00:21:32.270 --> 00:21:34.020
Are you okay, Takao?

00:21:35.100 --> 00:21:36.940
This place isn't safe!

00:21:36.940 --> 00:21:39.900
We need to evacuate!

00:21:40.230 --> 00:21:41.270
No.

00:21:42.400 --> 00:21:45.610
Our battle
isn't over yet!

00:21:45.950 --> 00:21:48.410
This isn't the time!

00:21:48.660 --> 00:21:52.700
It's exactly the time!
We're having a Beybattle!

00:21:52.700 --> 00:21:54.910
I can't leave him!

00:21:55.660 --> 00:22:00.590
Brooklyn's a bad guy,
but we're Bladers!

00:22:00.590 --> 00:22:03.420
We can understand each other
if we fight our hardest!

00:22:03.420 --> 00:22:06.380
That's what I believed!
But now...

00:22:06.380 --> 00:22:09.140
To think that this
is Brooklyn's heart...

00:22:09.140 --> 00:22:12.180
It's sad. It's way
too damn sad!

00:22:13.850 --> 00:22:15.350
Kinomiya...

00:22:15.350 --> 00:22:21.310
We've come all this way to return
Beyblading to the way it used to be!

00:22:21.310 --> 00:22:24.190
But now,
winning isn't enough!

00:22:24.190 --> 00:22:30.200
If I can't change his heart with my passionate
Beyspirit, it's as good as losing!

00:22:30.200 --> 00:22:32.200
Don't you guys agree?!

00:22:32.580 --> 00:22:36.410
Which is why I want
to keep fighting!

00:22:36.410 --> 00:22:37.910
Against him!

00:22:37.910 --> 00:22:41.710
Then there's nothing left to
worry about. Go, Kinomiya!

00:22:49.050 --> 00:22:50.390
Kai!

00:22:50.390 --> 00:22:55.930
Take the path you believe in.
No matter what lies at the end of it!

00:22:55.930 --> 00:22:59.440
Put everything on
the line, Kinomiya!

00:23:00.440 --> 00:23:01.690
Kai...!

00:23:03.150 --> 00:23:09.280
You're right. I need to talk
to him with our Beys!

00:23:09.280 --> 00:23:10.570
Takao...

00:23:10.570 --> 00:23:11.950
Takao...!

00:23:12.570 --> 00:23:16.240
What? I'm just gonna
go finish what I started.

00:23:16.240 --> 00:23:17.750
--Takao!

00:23:20.500 --> 00:23:23.250
Okay!
Let's go, Dragoon!

00:23:34.260 --> 00:23:38.810
Let's show him what an
awesome Beyspirit looks like!

00:23:47.570 --> 00:23:52.490
What is this?
What exactly is going on here?

00:23:52.490 --> 00:23:57.290
What do we do in the face
of such awesome power?!

00:24:11.550 --> 00:24:13.340
This is...!

00:24:29.150 --> 00:24:32.860
How's that? No one
can touch me now...

00:24:33.240 --> 00:24:38.450
That's right... I am a bird!
I can fly in the sky...

00:24:38.450 --> 00:24:40.660
Without anyone
getting in my way...

00:24:48.630 --> 00:24:53.130
Yes... I can fly without
anyone getting in my way...

00:25:04.980 --> 00:25:07.770
Are you happy flying
in this pitch-black sky?

00:25:08.770 --> 00:25:10.070
Brooklyn!

00:25:12.240 --> 00:25:13.450
Damn you!

00:25:17.200 --> 00:25:21.750
This isn't the sky!
The sky is bluer!

00:25:21.750 --> 00:25:23.330
And bigger!

00:25:23.620 --> 00:25:26.210
If you're gonna fly,
let's fly together!

00:25:26.710 --> 00:25:27.790
Come on!

00:25:30.920 --> 00:25:34.260
Stay back!

00:25:36.430 --> 00:25:39.050
Why? You don't
have to do this!

00:25:39.050 --> 00:25:43.020
What's so fun about being
all alone in a place like this?!

00:25:45.890 --> 00:25:48.980
You would never understand!

00:25:49.860 --> 00:25:52.900
You could never understand!!

00:26:08.750 --> 00:26:11.090
Don't interfere!!

00:26:20.350 --> 00:26:22.760
Stay back!!

00:26:26.390 --> 00:26:31.110
You'll never understand...
How I feel...

00:26:31.480 --> 00:26:32.820
No one will...

00:26:32.820 --> 00:26:34.730
You're right, I don't!

00:26:43.120 --> 00:26:45.870
That's what I'm
here to figure out!

00:26:46.290 --> 00:26:49.670
Because that's how I roll!

00:26:54.460 --> 00:26:56.710
Damn it all!

00:26:59.930 --> 00:27:02.550
--Takao!

00:27:02.550 --> 00:27:04.890
What an amazing sound...

00:27:04.890 --> 00:27:06.600
A sound...

00:27:06.850 --> 00:27:10.060
No, that's not it!
Those are voices!

00:27:10.060 --> 00:27:11.350
Voices...?

00:27:14.360 --> 00:27:16.940
Yeah, those are...

00:27:24.990 --> 00:27:28.450
He's a genius, so he doesn't
know how it feels to lose.

00:27:30.710 --> 00:27:35.130
Let's do it!
Evolution Storm!

00:27:46.760 --> 00:27:50.690
He's a genius, so he doesn't
know the value of hard work.

00:27:52.980 --> 00:27:55.440
Damn it!!

00:27:56.230 --> 00:28:00.990
He doesn't know how to laugh or cry from the bottom of his heart.

00:28:00.990 --> 00:28:02.910
It's the burden
of a genius!

00:28:10.910 --> 00:28:14.790
He's never known what
it's like to yearn.

00:28:14.790 --> 00:28:17.500
Brooklyn's soul
is crying out!

00:28:33.100 --> 00:28:36.150
That's it...
I get it now...

00:28:49.830 --> 00:28:50.620
Takao!

00:28:50.700 --> 00:28:52.580
Takao!

00:29:02.010 --> 00:29:04.090
Hey, Brooklyn...

00:29:05.260 --> 00:29:11.140
Doing the best you can and
working 'till you drop isn't so bad.

00:29:12.390 --> 00:29:15.900
We lose, we cry,
and get frustrated...

00:29:15.900 --> 00:29:19.070
But if you can get back up again,
you can keep moving.

00:29:19.070 --> 00:29:23.240
You can laugh right from your gut
because you gave it an honest effort!

00:29:23.240 --> 00:29:26.990
You just don't know how
great of a feeling that is.

00:29:27.570 --> 00:29:32.870
That's why you can't cry all alone! You should come play with us!

00:29:32.870 --> 00:29:37.960
Let's battle again and again
together until we drop!

00:29:39.250 --> 00:29:43.800
You say that, but you're all just
gonna leave me anyway.

00:29:43.800 --> 00:29:47.840
Because you can't beat me.
Everyone's gonna leave!

00:29:47.840 --> 00:29:49.600
Brooklyn...

00:29:49.600 --> 00:29:52.640
That's why I
don't need this!

00:29:52.640 --> 00:29:55.310
You all have to disappear!

00:29:55.310 --> 00:29:59.560
No, I'm not lying to you!
You gotta listen to me, Brooklyn!

00:30:00.730 --> 00:30:04.690
That's right... None of you
can beat me anyway...

00:30:04.690 --> 00:30:09.370
You're trying to fool me,
because you know you can't win!

00:30:11.780 --> 00:30:15.660
There isn't anyone in the world
who can beat me and my power!

00:30:16.210 --> 00:30:17.920
Why you...!

00:30:17.920 --> 00:30:21.630
You're on! If words won't
work, I'll try action!

00:30:21.630 --> 00:30:24.760
I won't lose, no matter what!

00:30:24.760 --> 00:30:27.840
I'll take on whatever
moves you bust out!

00:30:46.190 --> 00:30:47.400
What's that?!

00:30:52.160 --> 00:30:57.790
No! Brooklyn has rejected Takao!
And if he uses that move here...

00:30:57.790 --> 00:31:00.330
You all have to get
out of here! Now!

00:31:02.090 --> 00:31:05.590
Come on! Brooklyn's ultimate
power is unpredictable!

00:31:05.590 --> 00:31:09.130
If you stay here,
it's going to get ugly!

00:31:09.130 --> 00:31:10.180
But we...

00:31:10.180 --> 00:31:13.390
We can't leave Takao!

00:31:14.010 --> 00:31:16.970
It's okay! Takao will win,
no matter what!

00:31:16.970 --> 00:31:19.890
That's right!
Takao can pull it off!

00:31:19.890 --> 00:31:23.020
Yeah, because
we're here for him!

00:31:23.860 --> 00:31:26.030
What trust they have...

00:31:26.440 --> 00:31:28.690
What bond they have...!

00:31:36.910 --> 00:31:40.370
Compared to them, we...

00:31:40.370 --> 00:31:44.630
Haven't done a thing,
even though we're friends!

00:31:44.630 --> 00:31:46.300
For him!

00:31:49.800 --> 00:31:53.470
This is the end! Begone!

00:31:53.470 --> 00:31:56.180
King of Darkness!!

00:32:12.660 --> 00:32:18.120
I can't let this beat me!
I can't afford to lose!

00:32:18.330 --> 00:32:21.870
Begone!!

00:32:25.330 --> 00:32:27.460
Takao!!

00:32:31.300 --> 00:32:32.930
That move...!

00:32:32.930 --> 00:32:34.510
Max!

00:32:37.510 --> 00:32:40.430
Kinomiya!!

00:32:48.610 --> 00:32:50.230
Yuriy!

00:32:55.780 --> 00:32:59.200
How do ya like that?
I don't run from anyone!

00:32:59.200 --> 00:33:01.950
That's why I'm here!

00:33:01.950 --> 00:33:04.920
Because I've got tons
of friends with me!

00:33:22.770 --> 00:33:24.560
Do it now, Kinomiya!

00:33:24.810 --> 00:33:27.610
Give him your best shot!

00:33:27.610 --> 00:33:28.860
Yeah!

00:33:29.610 --> 00:33:32.940
Go, Dragoon!

00:33:34.900 --> 00:33:36.200
Max...

00:33:37.820 --> 00:33:39.200
Rei...

00:33:40.370 --> 00:33:41.660
Daichi...

00:33:43.200 --> 00:33:45.120
And Kai...!

00:33:47.670 --> 00:33:53.510
This is our burning,
raging Beyspirit!

00:33:59.680 --> 00:34:01.510
Dragoon changed!

00:34:01.510 --> 00:34:04.600
The Bey answered
our feelings!

00:34:04.600 --> 00:34:10.440
By bringing all our power together, the ultimate Bey has been born right before our eyes!

00:34:14.030 --> 00:34:16.860
Zeus!!

00:34:41.220 --> 00:34:49.100
"Bakuten Shoot Beyblade G-Revolution"

00:35:22.350 --> 00:35:24.010
Hey, that's...

00:35:35.860 --> 00:35:39.860
Come on!
The real battle is just beginning!

00:35:46.120 --> 00:35:47.870
Bring it on!

00:35:49.870 --> 00:35:51.870
If you say so!

00:35:54.380 --> 00:35:55.460
Takao...

00:35:57.420 --> 00:35:58.920
Brooklyn!

00:36:04.050 --> 00:36:07.640
Sweet, those two
are still battling?

00:36:08.810 --> 00:36:11.140
Let's go, too!

00:36:20.900 --> 00:36:25.780
How could this happen?!
My BEGA! This can't be...!

00:36:30.290 --> 00:36:32.290
Oh, everyone!

00:36:32.290 --> 00:36:33.710
Move it, gramps!

00:36:35.380 --> 00:36:39.800
Wait, all of you!
I won't allow this!

00:36:52.100 --> 00:36:58.320
Damn it, I made BEGA
for all of you little ingrates!

00:36:58.520 --> 00:37:02.190
Get back here!
Listen when I'm talking to you!

00:37:02.190 --> 00:37:04.490
You're wasting your
breath, Chairman Volkov.

00:37:04.910 --> 00:37:11.200
It's over.
You can't stop those kids.

00:37:11.950 --> 00:37:15.460
What did you say?
What the hell are you talking about?!

00:37:15.460 --> 00:37:20.960
I worked day after day to develop
new rivals for Takao and his friends.

00:37:20.960 --> 00:37:23.630
To put bigger and bigger
walls in their way.

00:37:24.300 --> 00:37:29.350
Though it seems like they've grown far beyond my wildest expectations.

00:37:29.350 --> 00:37:31.470
Look for yourself.

00:37:50.530 --> 00:37:52.910
That's it! You can do it!

00:37:52.910 --> 00:37:54.620
Go for it, Takao!

00:37:54.620 --> 00:37:56.170
Brooklyn!

00:37:56.170 --> 00:37:59.040
Now then!
Who will be the--

00:38:00.130 --> 00:38:03.090
Go! I'm rooting
for you both!

00:38:05.420 --> 00:38:09.800
Now they don't have any fancy special moves left. Or even a stadium.

00:38:09.800 --> 00:38:14.390
Even so, their eyes are
shining like never before.

00:38:14.890 --> 00:38:16.020
Takao!

00:38:16.020 --> 00:38:17.270
Go for it!

00:38:17.270 --> 00:38:18.560
Go, go!

00:38:18.560 --> 00:38:19.480
Yes, that's it!

00:38:19.480 --> 00:38:21.020
Whoop 'im good!

00:38:30.450 --> 00:38:32.280
That's the way, Brooklyn!

00:38:32.280 --> 00:38:33.910
Keep going!

00:38:33.910 --> 00:38:35.200
Go, go!

00:38:36.870 --> 00:38:40.920
Go, Brooklyn!
You too, Takao!

00:38:41.170 --> 00:38:46.880
There are no longer friends or enemies.
Anyone can have fun, no matter where or when.

00:38:46.880 --> 00:38:50.260
That's what it means to
have a true Beybattle!

00:39:11.320 --> 00:39:15.620
They didn't need
BEGA or a pro league.

00:39:15.620 --> 00:39:19.790
We have lost this battle.

00:39:20.500 --> 00:39:22.460
That's impossible...

00:39:23.340 --> 00:39:27.630
This is the end.
You've done good, Takao...

00:39:32.390 --> 00:39:35.970
You've surpassed me.

00:39:38.600 --> 00:39:43.610
Looks like I'm the one who
needs to start back from square one.

00:39:46.980 --> 00:39:49.450
All right,
it's time to end this!

00:39:50.110 --> 00:39:52.820
Yeah.
Bring it, Kinomiya!

00:40:16.430 --> 00:40:18.640
--Go!!

00:40:36.490 --> 00:40:38.580
This is Beyblade News.

00:40:38.580 --> 00:40:43.500
A large number of children have begun to
practice at the new BBA headquarters,

00:40:43.500 --> 00:40:48.840
which has recently restarted
operation after a nationwide takeover.

00:40:49.420 --> 00:40:51.050
Go...

00:40:51.050 --> 00:40:59.640
Shoot!

00:41:03.640 --> 00:41:07.520
Well well, isn't
this the sight to see?

00:41:11.400 --> 00:41:14.740
Looks like we've got quite the
impressive restart going here.

00:41:14.740 --> 00:41:20.040
This is all thanks to the young
Bladers like Takao many others.

00:41:20.410 --> 00:41:25.580
To meet their expectations, we'll have to start the world championships again.

00:41:25.580 --> 00:41:31.010
If we have everyone's help,
the BBA can grow again.

00:41:31.340 --> 00:41:34.720
With great kids like them.

00:41:36.470 --> 00:41:39.640
We can't leave 'em
alone just yet, can we?

00:41:40.470 --> 00:41:42.220
Oh, indeed!

00:41:42.430 --> 00:41:44.600
The world championships, huh?

00:41:45.350 --> 00:41:48.770
If the next one comes,
what are you going to do, Rei?

00:41:48.770 --> 00:41:50.360
Let me think...

00:41:50.360 --> 00:41:53.280
I'd love to team up with
the G-Revolutions again,

00:41:53.280 --> 00:41:56.820
and have another face off
against Brooklyn and his team...

00:41:56.820 --> 00:41:57.910
However...

00:41:57.910 --> 00:42:02.450
I'm in the same boat. I wanna
fight alongside the PPB again...

00:42:02.450 --> 00:42:04.580
Man, I can't decide!

00:42:04.580 --> 00:42:08.130
Quit actin' so carefree
and get back to work!

00:42:08.130 --> 00:42:12.460
Dangit, Takao's gone off to
who-knows-where and we need him now!

00:42:12.710 --> 00:42:16.260
Come to think of it,
I don't see Kai around here either...

00:42:16.260 --> 00:42:18.260
Takao and Kai...?

00:42:21.470 --> 00:42:24.980
Man, that feels good!

00:42:25.770 --> 00:42:30.150
I couldn't catch a break
because of all that's happened...

00:42:30.610 --> 00:42:33.860
But a promise is a promise!

00:42:36.400 --> 00:42:38.610
Alright, you wanna go?

00:42:43.290 --> 00:42:45.160
Oh, there they are!

00:42:45.450 --> 00:42:47.620
We figured you'd
both be here!

00:42:49.500 --> 00:42:53.960
Hey, that's not fair!
Takao, fight with me too!

00:42:53.960 --> 00:42:55.590
Please, wait up!

00:42:55.590 --> 00:42:58.720
Goodness, they never
change, do they?

00:42:58.720 --> 00:42:59.800
Wait for me!

00:42:59.800 --> 00:43:02.550
--Rei?
--Yeah, let's go!

00:43:30.120 --> 00:43:32.170
Hold on!

00:43:32.630 --> 00:43:35.550
--Three! Two! One!
--Three! Two! One!

00:43:35.550 --> 00:43:38.340
--Go, Shoot!
--Go, Shoot!

00:43:38.340 --> 00:43:40.090
Let's go, Dragoon!

00:43:40.090 --> 00:43:42.340
Roar, Dranzer!
